  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4304.03 Penalty or Interest Assessments. Late payment or late filing of the fees due under the provisions of RSA 146-A shall result in penalty and interest assessments as specified in RSA 146-A:11-b, IV and Saf-C 304.05(h).\n\nSource. #7219, eff 3-29-00 (from Saf-C 4303.03), EXPIRED: 3-29-08\n\nNew. #9376, eff 1-30-09; ss by #10026, eff 11-16-11; ss by #13037, eff 4-20-20",
